    // 3. Pressure Management: If this is the last fitting bin, favor it to avoid opening a new bin prematurely.
    // However, if the post_residual is very tight (e.g., < 5), it might be better to open a new bin.
    if fitting_bins_count == 1 && post_residual >= 5 {
